<!--
  PALETTE: Chalk & Oxblood

  Cool chalk neutrals with a deep iron-red accent — the most literal lifting-gym
  reference of the four. The neutrals shift to a blue-black hue family (#15161A),
  which is what stops this reading as Paper-with-a-red-accent.

  Note the intent colours: oxblood IS the strength intent here, so build moves to an
  ochre well clear of the accent. Keeping four intents separable inside each palette
  matters more than matching the accent.
-->
